"With a jumbo generator, up to three optimised hide tanner makers can be run at a time, potentially resulting in multiplying the profit, at the expense of being limited in terms of what other machines can be used. Additionally, with a fully upgraded Workshop in Fort Forinthry, four can be used, but there will be no power left for any other machines. To allow profit to be easily calculated for any combination of machines, this page calculates profit on a per-machine basis.",
