"Morchella mushroom",
"There are three mushroom patches. Start at the mushroom patch west of Canifis. The simplest way to get to the patch is by using the fairy ring CKS, which teleports you steps from the patch. Once you're there, harvest the mushrooms and plant new ones. Next teleport to the Isafdar patch directly with the Tirannwn quiver 3 or use the Tirannwn lodestone and go west through the dense forest then run south to the Isafdar mushroom patch. Harvest and replant the mushrooms. Finally, if you have 80 Necromancy, teleport to the City of Um using the Underworld Grimoire (Um smithy) and go west to the mushroom patch. Harvest, and replant the mushrooms there. Alternatively, if the Passing bracelet is obtained, players can rub the bracelet and choose the first option (City of Um: Hanging Gardens) The patches have a growing time of 240 minutes - reduced to 200 if the spores are planted with a Sunburst bracelet equipped.",
