"Assumes 2,000 smelts per hour. Adjust the rate to match your own pace.",
"The 10% extra-bar chance at 27 Smithing is not included in this estimate.",
"Bring iron ore and coal to a furnace and deposit the ores in the metal bank.",
"Select steel bars at the furnace and smelt them.",
"Deposit the finished bars in the metal bank and repeat. Adjust smelts per hour to your own rate.",
