"adding-herbs-to-incense-sticks.kwuarm",
"Kwuarm",
"54 Firemaking",
"Accursed acadia incense sticks",
"Making incense sticks is a profitable way to gain Firemaking experience, although slower than usual training methods. Kwuarm incense sticks is useful in PvM when using weapon poison.",
"27 incense sticks can be made per inventory, and each inventory takes 48.6 seconds. A bank preset of a stack of Accursed acadia incense sticks and 27 Clean kwuarm is recommended to achieve a maximum of close to 972 sticks made per hour.",
"However, there is not much trading volume and profit margin for whoever makes those, therefore you may find it hard to buy Accursed acadia incense sticks on the Grand Exchange.",
"adding-herbs-to-incense-sticks.lantadyme",
"Lantadyme",
"67 Firemaking",
"Infernal yew incense sticks",
"Making incense sticks is a profitable way to gain Firemaking experience, although slower than usual training methods. Lantadyme incense sticks is useful in PvM to reduce the cost of using potions when using multiple high level potions at once.",
"27 incense sticks can be made per inventory, and each inventory takes 48.6 seconds. A bank preset of a stack of Infernal yew incense sticks and 27 Clean lantadyme is recommended to achieve a maximum of close to 972 sticks made per hour.",
"However, there is not much trading volume and profit margin for whoever makes those, therefore you may find it hard to buy Infernal yew incense sticks on the Grand Exchange.",
"adding-herbs-to-incense-sticks.spirit-weed",
