"Reinforcing plate",
"Algarum thread",
"Broad arrowheads",
"Next, bank all items except a method to teleport away while in level 23 wilderness if you have it, such as dragonstone teleport jewellery or Wilderness sword 4.",
"Teleport to the Wilderness Crater lodestone and run northwest until you reach the Bandit Camp.",
"Or use Portable obelisk to teleport to level 27 wilderness and run south (warning: location is surrounded by Abyssal savages).",
"Bandit Camp",
"You need to be skulled to enter, causing you to lose all supplies if you are killed by another player. Construction materials consistently sell far below the GE guide price. The large amount of starting cash and small profit margins may cause you to waste nearly all of the GP spent on items with deflated resale value.",
