"Ranarrs are the most commonly traded herb, and they are used to create Prayer potions. It is often profitable to clean the grimy herbs and sell them on the Grand Exchange. Like all methods involving large amounts of buying and selling, it is recommended to test the market first to make sure cleaning ranarr is profitable.",
"Please note that Grimy ranarr have a buying limit of 10,000 every four hours, so you may clean them faster than you can buy them.",
