"Completing the Zarosian I collection has a very high output of chronotes per hour and can easily be done very early on. However, the gold becomes much more efficient per hour at 50+ Archaeology, while still remaining decent experience per hour due to faster clear times. Players should have no issues completing the Zarosian I collection in an hour (or less) at levels 50+. Profit assumes buying the remaining materials, estimated at half of the total cost of materials. Profit will be higher or lower depending on level/materials obtained per artefact.",
"Rotate excavation hotspots lowest to highest, starting at venator remains and working your way down to administratum debris.",
"completing-the-zarosian-collection.zarosian-ii",
"Zarosian II",
"Complete the Zarosian II collection. Collect the drops listed in Outputs and restock supplies between trips.",
"Completing the Zarosian II collection has an extremely high output of chronotes. This assumes that you complete a collection in an hour (could take more or less time depending on stats/gear). Profit assumes buying the remaining materials, estimated at half of the total cost of materials (more than half for some of the rarer materials to obtain while collecting artefacts, and less than half for some of the more common). Profit will be higher or lower depending on level/gear/materials obtained per artefact.",
