"crafting-emerald-jewellery.amulets",
"Amulets",
"The first process of this method requires combining gold bars and emeralds in a furnace. The Lumbridge furnace is one of the fastest ones to use. You should make a preset with 28 emeralds for faster efficiency. Withdraw your preset from the bank, run over to the furnace, start crafting the emerald amulets and then repeat.",
"When done you should make another preset with 14 unstrung emerald amulets and 14 ball of wool. It should take you 10 seconds per inventory including banking time.",
"You should be on a world with low ping for better efficiency.",
"crafting-emerald-jewellery.amulets-of-defence",
"Amulets of Defence",
"Amulet of defence",
"The first process of this method requires combining gold bars and emeralds in a furnace to make unstrung emerald amulets. The Lumbridge furnace is one of the fastest ones to use. You should make a preset with 28 emeralds for faster efficiency. Withdraw your preset from the bank, run over to the furnace, start crafting the emerald amulets and then repeat.",
"Upon completion of all of these unstrung amulets, proceed to string all of them using balls of wool. The stringing should not take nearly as long as either of the two other processes. The player should make a preset with 14 unstrung emerald amulets and 14 ball of wool. It should take around 10 seconds per inventory.",
"The final step in this method is to enchant the amulets by using the Lvl-2 Enchant spell in your standard spellbook. It's recommended to move this spell to your action bar for better efficiency. Wielding a staff of air will remove the need for any air runes and save you a lot of money in the long run. The player should make a preset with 27 cosmic runes and 27 emerald amulets. This action takes around 34 seconds.",
"crafting-emerald-jewellery.necklaces",
"29 Crafting",
"Emerald necklace",
"Emerald necklaces are made by combining a gold bar and an emerald. It is recommended that you make a bank preset with 28 emeralds.",
"The process is fairly click intensive, and very tedious. You'll need a furnace to craft the emerald necklaces, this can be done at the Lumbridge furnace, across the street from the Combat Academy bank.",
"The time taken to craft and bank is about 64 seconds for 28 necklaces.",
"crafting-emerald-jewellery.stringing-amulets",
"Stringing amulets",
"Emerald amulet (unstrung)",
"For this method the player needs to stand close to a bank. Make a preset of 14 emerald amulets (unstrung) and 14 ball of wool. To string the amulets simply left click a ball of wool and then left click an emerald amulet (unstrung), the interface will open up and you'll just have to press \"spacebar\" to begin the action. This process should take around 10 seconds per inventory meaning you can string 5,040 amulets an hour.",
"It is also possible to work around the limit by directly trading with other players or by using alternate accounts.",
