"If you don't have 100% pouch degradation reduction, make sure to regularly repair the pouches as the giant pouch degrades after 12 uses. You can repair your pouches for free at the Dark mage in the centre of the Abyss. Alternatively you can cast Repair rune pouch on your pouches, making them last five times as long. The suggested preset is as follows (the Mobile perk is strongly recommended on an off-hand like enhanced excalibur if you do not have the Shadow's Grace relic).",
"Break a nature altar teleport tablet. It teleports the player to the ruins.",
"Use the Karamja gloves 3 or 4 to teleport to the gemstone cavern, take the ladder to the surface, exit Shilo Village by the shortcut to the north, and go north-east to the ruins.",
"Use fairy ring code CKR and run north-east to the ruins.",
"The Mage of Zamorak is located in low-level wilderness, near the source of the River Lum. Make sure PvP is toggled off by talking to Vala in Edgeville. See Abyss for more information on how to navigate the abyss. Once inside, enter the nature rift and craft the essence in your inventory and your pouches. Teleport back to Edgeville with Amulet of Glory or Wilderness Sword and repeat.",
