"Cutting willow and oak logs in Varrock by using the wood box.",
"An experiment, on a F2P ironman character.",
"It took 25 minutes, using a rune hatchet, including teleporting to and fro from Burthorpe to Varrock lodestone, to fill the wood box (being able to hold 160 logs at 70 woodcutting) and inventory on each 3 tries. 9 Woodcutting Urns were also used.",
"fill wood box, willow logs: 14 minutes.",
"fill wood box, oak logs: 10 minutes.",
"Varrock lodestone is located by the south gate.",
"Varrock Teleport or the teletab teleports to the main square. The destination can be changed to southern Grand Exchange entrance (requires Easy Varrock achievements) or north-east church (requires Elite Varrock achievements).",
"A Grand Exchange Teleport, ring of wealth, ring of fortune, or luck of the dwarves can be used to teleport to the Grand Exchange.",
"Use It took 25 minutes, using a rune hatchet, including teleporting to and fro from Burthorpe to Varrock lodestone, to fill the wood box (being able to hold 160 logs at 70 woodcutting) and inventory on each 3 tries. 9 Woodcutting Urns were also used.",
