"45 Fletching (recommended)",
"Fletching Logs into shafts can be done semi afk as an inventory takes approximately 52 seconds, which results to around 1938 fletched logs an hour. Simply buy some logs, stand by a bank and begin. The player should make a preset of 28 logs to make the process faster. Additionally, adding a log to the action bar may help the player to be more efficient as it reduces clicks.",
