"Assumes the guide's 732 actions per hour. Adjust it to your own pace.",
"Box trap hunt the crystal skillchompas north of Tyras camp. You can catch ~2600 skillchompas an hour based on intensity and whether or not you have access to the volcanic trapper outfit and hunter skillcape perk. Agility level 99 is not required, but it gives a guarantee that you catch multiple skillchompas per trap.",
"However, the amount caught per trap scales with Agility level; from level 99 Agility, this amount will be from 2 up to 6.",
