"hunting-implings.standard",
"Hunting implings",
"Money making guide/Hunting implings",
"83 Hunter",
"20 Magic",
"Jar generator",
"Wand",
"Magic butterfly net or Wand",
"91 Hunter (recommended)",
"79 Magic (recommended)",
