"Kill Nex. Collect the drops listed in Outputs and restock supplies between trips.",
"Your actual profit may be higher or lower depending on your speed and if you are soloing or duoing.",
"As the best method to killing Nex is with entering a fresh instance to force her Deflect Magic attack, players should use the Max Guild or War's Retreat portal to get directly to Nex. Equipping the ancient ceremonial armour, or completing Gielinor's Most Expensive Doorstop before using either portal will place you in the lobby room instead of the beginning of the dungeon. If you are using God Wars Dungeon teleport, protection from the zarosian mobs is necessary, items such as the Shard of Zaros or Virtus wand is required.",
"killing-nex-angel-of-death.4-player",
"4-player",
"A team of 4 players",
"Assumes the guide's 16 kills per hour. Adjust it to your own pace.",
"Kill Nex, Angel of Death (4-player). Collect the drops listed in Outputs and restock supplies between trips.",
"In a four player encounter, the drop rate of the praesul codex is 1/144, while the wand of the praesul and imperium core have a drop rate of 1/1136. Four-player scales are more profitable than seven player due to the increased rate of codices, but it additionally requires the base tank doubling as a mage tank, or one mage tank taking on two praesuls.",
"killing-nex-angel-of-death.7-player",
"7-player",
"A team of 7 players",
"Assumes the guide's 22 kills per hour. Adjust it to your own pace.",
"Kill Nex, Angel of Death (7-player). Collect the drops listed in Outputs and restock supplies between trips.",
"In a seven player encounter, the drop rate of a praesul codex is 1/252, while the wand of the praesul and imperium core are 1/1988. Seven player kills are very fast, but profit is generally lower because of the decreased drop rate of codices.",
"7 players",
"killing-nex-angel-of-death.duo",
"A team of 2 players",
"Assumes the guide's 11 kills per hour. Adjust it to your own pace.",
"Kill Nex, Angel of Death (Duo). Collect the drops listed in Outputs and restock supplies between trips.",
"In a duo encounter, the drop rate of the praesul codex is 1/72, while the wand of the praesul and imperium core are 1/568. Duo is fairly hard, as it is a master combat achievement and requires roles to be compacted.",
"killing-nex-angel-of-death.solo",
"A team of 1 player",
"Kill Nex, Angel of Death (Solo). Collect the drops listed in Outputs and restock supplies between trips.",
"Solo AoD is incredibly challenging, being a grandmaster combat achievement. Unlike other scales, players will take a tremendous amount of damage during the fight to the point that a beast of burden is necessary over other familiars. Solos should only be done for the sake of a challenge; while the drop rate for the praesul codex is 1/36 and the wand of the praesul and imperium core 1/284, the time and supplies needed for a solo kill do not give it much of an advantage over duos.",
