"killing-abyssal-beasts.low-requirements",
"Low requirements",
"This setup will achieve approximately 300 kills per hour, change the Kills per hour at the top of the guide to 300 to see approximate profits with this setup.",
"This setup is designed for balancing maximum AFK time and minimum requirements. Potion reservoirs allow players to only check in once every five minutes (to prevent being kicked to lobby) to note potions. The combination of Ice Asylum, a blood necklace, and Sacrifice means players don't need to worry about health. This inventory support four-hour trips and can be easily scaled up by adding more aggression flasks (at the cost of being able to pick up fewer potions.) A legendary pet should be used to automatically pick up potion drops.",
