"killing-mature-grotworms.standard",
"Killing mature grotworms",
"Money making guide/Killing mature grotworms",
"50 Agility (recommended)",
"Kill mature grotworms. Collect the drops listed in Outputs and restock supplies between trips.",
"Mature grotworms drop adamant and rune very often. It's best to use High Level Alchemy on these drops to avoid banking too often. Alternatively, players can bring a spring cleaner. They also drop royal dragonhide and varying herbs and seeds uncommonly. If you pick up all these items, you'll generally have to bank about once per hour.",
"Mature grotworms are found in the bottom level of the Grotworm Lair, which can be accessed by either a long trek through the cave, or a shortcut requiring 50 Agility. Alternatively, players can teleport directly to the grotworms using Remora's necklace teleport after completing Song from the Depths. The grotworms are level 98 and have 12500 life points, so they are much harder to kill than they used to be. They are weak to bolts so it may be worth it to use Ranged against them, but a Magic weapon above level 70 (such as a Staff of light or Polypore staff) is also fairly effective. Consider using Soul Split or a bunyip, but the grotworms also drop two un-noted sharks commonly.",
"killing-mithril-dragons.standard",
"Killing mithril dragons",
"Money making guide/Killing mithril dragons",
"Barbarian Training",
"Large plated mithril salvage",
"Kill mithril dragons. Collect the drops listed in Outputs and restock supplies between trips.",
"They are located on the upper level of the Ancient Cavern, which requires Barbarian Training to access. The area is multicombat and the dragons are aggressive. Drink your super antifire, pray Soul Split and possibly Torment, and start attacking one of them with basic abilities, using the thresholds Wild Magic and Asphyxiate when available. Pick up the mithril salvage, dragon bones and any other items worth keeping, and repeat. When your inventory and your war tortoise or pack yak are full, use the TokKul-Zo to teleport next to the TzHaar Fight Cave, and bank your loot. Run north to the fairy ring and use the code BJQ to return to the Ancient Cavern.",
