"killing-the-arch-glacor.hard-mode-200-killstreak",
"Hard Mode 200 killstreak",
"This guide is meant as a frame of reference for streaking at Arch Glacor, actually completing a 200 killstreak is sufficiently hard that it has its own grandmaster combat achievement, so should not be taken lightly. Profit is massively reduced if you die during a kill, as you will lose items, and likely lose all of your uniques.",
"The rate of uniques is given by the calculator, which is 1.0372 cores per streak and 1.6422 of each of scriptures and artefacts. The expected number of nilas drops per streak is 2, but the quantity dropped ranges from 2 to 42, depending on when in the streak it drops, for an average of 44 per streak.",
