"making-primal-extracts.102-herblore",
"The theoretical maximum number of crafts per hour is 3000, however it is very unlikely that a player will reach this due to various factors such as lag and imperfect timing/inputs. With this level you will only be able to make 26 extracts per inventory (13 crafts) as you will need 1 slot for the pulp causing an odd number of remaining slots for vials. The herblore requirement for this level is not boostable.",
"making-primal-extracts.112-herblore",
"The theoretical maximum number of crafts per hour is 3000, however it is very unlikely that a player will reach this due to various factors such as lag and imperfect timing/inputs. This level yields the highest profit but requires more frequent inputs from the player as you will only perform 9 crafts per inventory taking 18 ticks or ~10.8 seconds. As with the previous level, the herblore requirement is not boostable.",
"making-primal-extracts.90-herblore",
"The theoretical maximum number of crafts per hour is 3000, however it is very unlikely that a player will reach this due to various factors such as lag and imperfect timing/inputs. This level is not recommended as the profit return is minimal compared to higher herblore levels.",
