"mining-luminite.standard",
"Mining luminite",
"Money making guide/Mining luminite",
"Adamant Pickaxe or better",
"Luminite can be mined in a few places, but one of the best is in the Dwarven luminite mine underneath Falador. It's recommended to have at least 15 dungeoneering as this allows you to enter the mysterious entrance close by into the Dwarven Mine resource dungeon where you will find a bank deposit box. This drastically decreases the time required to bank. Carrying an adamant ore box or better allows the player to hold more ores before needing to bank. The output is calculated having full stamina at all times. Sedimentary geodes will also be received while mining and they can later be opened to retrieve spirit shards and different gems. Wearing an amulet of glory increases the chance of receiving geodes by 1%. The player should use the best pickaxe possible as it will grant more ores per hour. Here you find a table over estimated profit per hour with different mining levels and pickaxes.",
"mining-mithril-ore.standard",
"Mining mithril ore",
"Money making guide/Mining mithril ore",
"Rune pickaxe",
"For a close approximation of ore mined per hour (of pure mining) based on your levels and gear see the mining rate calculator. Below is a table of estimated profit per hour with different mining levels and pickaxes.",
"mining-necrite-ore.standard",
"Mining necrite ore",
"Money making guide/Mining necrite ore",
"76 recommended for chance to get double ore",
"80 recommended to use Tagga's corehammer",
"Use your necklaces and energy to create signs of the porter. If you have a grace of the elves, it can prolong your trips by compacting up to 500 sign of the porter charges.",
"Travel to any necrite rock cluster, drink your perfect juju mining potion, summon your lava titan, equip your a sign of the porter and begin mining. While the perfect juju potion is in effect, each ore-receiving swing gives a 10% chance to gain a bottled stone spirit of the type of ore mined. The perfect juju potion will also restore your mining stamina to full for every necrite stone spirit consumed. The necrite stone spirit will add an extra ore for every ore you mine, gaining extra profit even if the cost of one necrite stone spirit is deducted. Equipping signs of the porter will allow the player to transfer all mined ores to the metal bank, consuming one charge per ore, including any additional ores gained from the necrite stone spirit.",
"Assuming the player actively clicks on rockertunities while afking in-between they should gain around 450 necrite ores an hour. The player's Strength level will affect the rates also.",
"mining-phasmatite-ore.standard",
"Mining phasmatite ore",
"Money making guide/Mining phasmatite ore",
"Necronium pickaxe or better",
"76 recommended for a chance to get double ore",
"99 optional for best rates",
"Phasmatite Ore can be mined and sold for good amounts. The use of stone spirits and perfect juju mining potions can further increase these rates.",
"Tagga's corehammer gives the player +10% critical strike chance and +35 critical strike damage, and also has a 5.8% chance of producing deathspore arrow tips.",
