"mining-red-and-crystal-sandstone.crystal-flecked-sandstone",
"Crystal-flecked sandstone",
"Master camouflage outfit for teleporting",
"Crystal flasks are used for Herblore potions. To get these flasks, mine the rock, turn the sandstone into glass and blow the glass into flasks (which are tradeable). You can use a Beast of Burden to store the sandstone.",
"Mine 28 crystal-flecked sandstone from the Ithell crystal sandstone rock.",
"Click on the crystal glass and create 28 crystal flasks.",
"Ithell crystal sandstone",
"Bank the crystal flasks and run back to the crystal-flecked sandstone rock.",
"mining-red-and-crystal-sandstone.red-sandstone",
"Red sandstone",
"29 recommended for agility shortcut",
"As a First Resort recommended for access to a nearby bank and Robust glass machine",
"Potion flasks are used for herblore potions. To get these flasks, mine the rock, turn the sandstone into glass and blow the glass into flasks (which are tradeable). You can use a beast of burden to store the sandstone.",
"Mine 28 red sandstone from the Oo'glog red sandstone rock.",
"Run through the nearby shortcut to the robust glass machine and create 28 robust glass.",
"Click on the robust glass and create 28 potion flasks.",
"Oo'glog red sandstone",
"Bank the potion flasks and run back to the red sandstone rock via the ability shortcut.",
"mining-runite-ore.free-to-play",
"Free to play",
"Rune ore box",
"Rune pickaxe (recommended)",
"Runite ore can be somewhat profitable to mine since it is used to make rune equipment and elder rune bars. There's a few places you can mine runite ore but one of the best is in the Mining Guild beneath Falador. It's recommended to bring a rune ore box as this will make the bank trips fewer. You can bank your ores at the metal bank in the Artisans' Workshop which is closest to the mine and allows you to store all metals in one click, keeping everything else in your inventory. You can also bank at the Falador bank located in the centre of Falador or you can use the deposit box in the Dwarven Mine resource dungeon. Both take about the same time. It takes 40 seconds to run and bank the ore and the run back to start mining. For a close approximation of ore mined per hour (of pure mining) based on your levels and gear see the mining rate calculator. Here's a table of estimated profit and experience gained depending on your mining level.",
"Runite ore can be somewhat profitable to mine since it is used to make rune equipment and elder rune bars. There's a few places you can mine runite ore but one of the best is in the Mining Guild beneath Falador. It's recommended to bring a rune ore box as this will make the bank trips fewer. You can bank your ores at the metal bank in the Artisans' Workshop which is closest to the mine and allows you to store all metals in one click, keeping everything else in your inventory. You can also bank at the Falador bank located in the centre of Falador or you can use the deposit box in the Dwarven Mine resource dungeon. Both take about the same time. It takes 40 seconds to run and bank the ore and the run back to start mining. For a close approximation of ore mined per hour (of pure mining) based on your levels and gear see the mining rate calculator.",
