"Luck of the Dwarves recommended (if using the ring of Vitur when pickpocketing)",
"Ring of Vitur",
"Pickpocketing consumers in the bank building allows for healing at the bank chest if caught, but players not using a relic + ring of Vitur combo should be wary that other players might open the door to use the bank chest.",
"A consumer may also be trapped within the building north of the thievable chests (marked on the minimap), which is generally only used by pickpocketers. If no consumer is in either building, players should hop worlds until they find one where this is the case.",
"raising-black-dragons-to-adolescent.standard",
"Raising black dragons to adolescent",
"Money making guide/Raising black dragons to adolescent",
"Raw desert sole",
"Can be done every 42 hours; a run takes about 2 minutes.",
"Black dragon eggs can be bought from the Grand Exchange and can reliably be sold to other players at the adolescent stage for a profit. This is done through direct trade to other players that are looking to sell these for beans.",
"raising-rex-dinosaurs.standard",
"Raising rex dinosaurs",
"Money making guide/Raising rex dinosaurs",
"106 (increased yield at 112 and 118)",
"90 to construct all pens",
"Bagrada rex (player-owned farm)",
"Corbicula rex (player-owned farm)",
"Pavosaurus rex (player-owned farm)",
"A breeding pair of Bagrada rex, Corbicula rex, or Pavosaurus rex",
"Rabbit tier 2 Farm totem perk recommended.",
"Master farmer outfit recommended for increased experience",
"Studly or virile perks on the breeding pair recommended. Studly is better than virile.",
"Breeding pen and large pens constructed at the Anachronia Dinosaur Farm.",
"Bottled dinosaur roar",
"Beans",
"Bottled dinosaur roars are used in high level potions (for example vulnerability bombs). Raising rex dinosaurs with the goal of getting these roars can be profitable while also giving a lot of farming experience. With an optimal setup, seven animals can be growing at all time on average, using a single breeding pair in the breeding pen. Higher level dinosaurs give more experience and resources.",
"The strategy for this method is as follows.",
"Go to the Anachronia Dinosaur Farm. It can be reached from a Max Guild garden skilling portal (including through grace of the elves), or the mystical tree upstairs in the Manor Farm.",
"Check the large pens and breeding pen. Any animals should be health checked, and any non-breeding elder animals should be removed. Make sure the troughs have enough food to last until your next visit.",
"Check the breeding pen. If the large pens have space, move non-breeding animals to large pens.",
"All methods require having visited Anachronia at least once to use them.",
"Use Grace of the elves teleport attuned via a Max Guild skill portal (after purchasing the Max guild portal attunement from the Anachronia Farmers' Market).",
"Use Anachronia Dinosaur Farm teleport to Prehistoric Potterington after completing Extinction and then purchasing it with beans.",
"Mystical tree on the west coast of Anachronia next to the campfire (where the broken compass can be found).",
"A comparison of all dinosaurs can be found on this subpage.",
"running-the-anachronia-agility-course-for-codex-pages.standard",
"Running the Anachronia Agility Course for codex pages",
"Money making guide/Running the Anachronia Agility Course for codex pages",
"85 Agility",
"Double Surge (5 Agility)",
"Luck",
"Codex to make",
"Each lap at the Anachronia Agility Course gives a guaranteed 10 codex pages. An additional 1-3 codex pages can be randomly received when completing any obstacle. By having at least tier three luck (such as a ring of fortune or a charged collector's insignia), players can improve their chances of gaining additional codex pages when completing obstacles. With tier 3 luck, each lap will grant a total of 12 codex pages on average.",
"The course is spread out with open areas between obstacles. Using Bladed Dive or Dive and Surge, along with the Mobile perk will allow for faster laps (up to an additional lap per hour). Powerbursts of acceleration can also be used to quickly surge and dive on parts of the course, further saving time. With double surge, dive, mobile, and an optimised route, players can expect lap times of around 6 minutes, allowing for 9 to 10 laps per hour. Double surge is highly recommended; without it, each lap will take 6:30 to 7 minutes or even longer, which hurts the profit rate significantly.",
"Once per day, a god banner can also be used to boost the player's Agility level by 5 for 30 minutes (roughly 4 laps).",
"The quickest way to get to the start of the course is by teleporting to the Anachronia lodestone.",
"If this lodestone has not been unlocked, then the player has to travel to Anachronia via the Stormbreaker in Archaeology Campus.",
"scavenging.standard",
"Money making guide/Scavenging",
"85 for Ancient Invention",
"Scavenging 4",
"Twisted bird skull necklace or higher variant",
"80 recommended in chosen combat style",
"92 recommended for Split Soul",
"Combat gear for AFK multi-target combat",
"Third-age components",
"Ecliptic components",
"Noxious components",
"Ilujankan components",
"Cywir components",
"Assumes the guide's 5,000 kills per hour. Adjust it to your own pace.",
"Killing any enemy while having the Scavenging perk equipped has a chance to award uncommon or rare components. Since the health of the enemy does not affect the chances, it is recommended to kill as many low-level enemies as possible, such as skeletons in the Lumbridge Catacombs. With high enough gear it is possible to get over 5,000 kills per hour.",
"See Guide for Scavenging for a detailed explanation of how to maximise kills per hour, what equipment to wear, and what abilities to use on your revolution bar.",
"This method will also award other components, however only the most valuable are shown here.",
"The guide suggests low-life-point enemies in Lumbridge Catacombs",
"Components have no sellable value, as they are untradeable items, so the \"profit\" that this guide mentions is the saved cost of obtaining these components via standard means. Additionally, there is a high amount of variance since obtaining the specifically valuable components is very rare.",
